<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">To&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Despite our several attempts to contact you and work out a resolution, we still have not heard back from you.&nbsp; In one last attempt to work out a resolution, we are willing to offer you the following:&nbsp;</span></span><br style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong>- Twenty (20) monthly payments of&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><font face="arial"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Settlement_Offer_20_Months__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.&nbsp; If you are unable to pay the above settlement amount, but still want to resolve prior to&nbsp;</span></span><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">a possible lawsuit</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">, please reach out to us via phone or email.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;">&nbsp;</span><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><div><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Thank you,&nbsp;</span></span></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Name__c}</span><font face="arial">&nbsp;| {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><strong style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">National Funding, Inc.</strong><span style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, the parent and servicing company of</span><br style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</strong></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">P: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">E: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Email__c}</font></div>]]></td>
